  "notes": "Backlog game, all-AAA pass: picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year across all genres (docs/PLAN.md section 2, genre filter widened 2026-10-23). RAWG's first result is the expected entry (id 15834); RAWG lists the five episodes as additions (All That Remains, A House Divided, In Harm's Way, Amid the Ruins, No Going Back). The Steam store list names app 261030 \"The Walking Dead: Season Two\"; its achievement schema says \"Season 2\". None of the 40 Steam achievements is hidden. The list runs in story order, eight per episode, and the eighth of each block names the episode it completes, so the achievements are placed by list block (names), not by description. StrategyWiki has no page under \"The Walking Dead: Season Two\" or \"The Walking Dead: Season 2\". walkingdead.fandom.com has no page under either title. Chapter summaries are drawn from the achievement descriptions."
